The SM103 block-128 gate implementation in
src/devices/cuda/moe/fastllm-shared-flex-block128-sm103.cuh also adapts the
prepared rows8 page pipeline and warp-MMA fragments from NaiveRT commit
79d5704ac32ff5fa756e9fb3a76829c236444d86 (Copyright 2026 NaiveAI).
FastLLM modifications include row-major TMA weight reads, exact FastLLM routing,
in-place power-of-two rebasing, paired MXFP8/32 output, balanced CTA scheduling,
and accumulation-order changes. The upstream Apache-2.0 license applies.
